CounterNotes:Paragraph({
    Title = 'what counts as an attack',
    Content = 'A basic swing always does, and so does anything that has stunned somebody or landed on a guard anywhere on the server. A move nobody has seen yet counts too, until it has gone off beside people eight times without ever hurting anyone - that is how dashes, sprints and auras stop setting it off without anybody having to list them.',
